<title>UK: DSL sets 200 million guilder six-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL sets 200 million guilder six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DFL   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    26.MAR.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.15    PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.55     SPREAD	+7.5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-1M   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    UK	  MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FEB 2003 DSL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
